                  "text": "1 Kor 10:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bali ninyi mmwachao BWANA, na kuusahau mlima wangu mtakatifu, na kuandika meza kwa ajili ya Bahati, na kuijazia Ajali vyombo vya divai iliyochanganyika; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
