        {
          "text": "Kwa hiyo Bwana MUNGU asema hivi, Tazama, watumishi wangu watakula, bali ninyi mtaona njaa; tazama, watumishi wangu watakunywa, bali ninyi mtaona kiu; tazama, watumishi wangu watafurahi, bali ninyi mtatahayarika; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
