                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao watajenga nyumba, na kukaa ndani yake; watapanda mizabibu, na kula matunda yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.21",
