          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hawatajenga, akakaa mtu mwingine ndani yake; hawatapanda, akala mtu mwingine; maana kama siku za mti ndivyo zitakavyokuwa siku za watu wangu, na wateule wangu wataifurahia kazi ya mikono yao muda wa siku nyingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
